design_artifacts.class_diagram_mermaid:
```mermaid
classDiagram
    class Token {
        +str type
        +Any value
    }
    class Operator {
        +str symbol
        +int precedence
        +str associativity
    }
    class ExpressionParser {
        +parse(expression: str) List[Token]
    }
    class ExpressionEvaluator {
        +evaluate(tokens: List[Token]) float
    }
    class ResultFormatter {
        +format_result(value: float) str
        +format_error(error: str) str
    }
    class Calculator {
        +calculate(expression: str) str
    }
    Calculator --> ExpressionParser
    Calculator --> ExpressionEvaluator
    Calculator --> ResultFormatter
    ExpressionParser --> Token
    ExpressionEvaluator --> Token
    ExpressionEvaluator --> Operator
```

